        <body>
            <div xml:id="d188">

                <pb facs="0239" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg189"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sleeper to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-09-13"><hi rendition="#italic">September 13,
                        1894</hi></date>. (Received October 8.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 69.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith
                    further correspondence between Colombia and Costa Rica, in regard to the
                    boundary question.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacob Sleeper</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires ad interim.</hi></signed></closer>




